---
layout: base.njk
title: Anime Genre Quiz
---

<section class="quiz-section">
  <h1>What Anime Genre Matches You?</h1>
  <p>Answer these questions and find out which anime genre fits your vibe.</p>

  <form id="anime-quiz-form">
    
    <div class="question-block">
      <h2>1. What kind of story sounds most interesting to you?</h2>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="story" value="action" required>
        Fast fights, big battles, and intense moments
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="story" value="adventure">
        Exploring new worlds and going on epic journeys
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="story" value="horror">
        Dark secrets, fear, and creepy twists
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="story" value="drama">
        Deep emotions, relationships, and personal struggles
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <h2>2. What kind of main character do you like most?</h2>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="character" value="action" required>
        Strong, fearless, and ready to fight
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="character" value="adventure">
        Curious, bold, and always chasing the unknown
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="character" value="horror">
        Mysterious, troubled, or trapped in danger
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="character" value="drama">
        Realistic, emotional, and complex
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <h2>3. What kind of setting do you prefer?</h2>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="setting" value="action" required>
        A world full of conflict and powerful enemies
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="setting" value="adventure">
        Fantasy lands, hidden places, or exciting destinations
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="setting" value="horror">
        Abandoned towns, haunted spaces, or unsettling places
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="setting" value="drama">
        Schools, homes, or everyday life with emotional tension
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <h2>4. Which mood appeals to you most?</h2>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="mood" value="action" required>
        Excitement and adrenaline
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="mood" value="adventure">
        Wonder and discovery
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="mood" value="horror">
        Suspense and fear
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="mood" value="drama">
        Emotion and reflection
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <h2>5. What would make you keep watching?</h2>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="hook" value="action" required>
        Crazy fight scenes and power-ups
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="hook" value="adventure">
        A journey with surprises and world-building
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="hook" value="horror">
        Unpredictable scares and disturbing mysteries
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="radio" name="hook" value="drama">
        Strong character development and emotional depth
      </label>
    </div>

    <button type="submit">Get My Genre</button>
  </form>

  <div id="result"></div>
</section>